{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8013","id":5221300207,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNza37w","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8013","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8013.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8013.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8013","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8013/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8013/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8013/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/044cc98a5d41f86e4c84b04d86c68924fa0621ca","number":8013,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(id): cursor tooltip modes/pin/minimize wiring + lifecycle logging (#1790 slices 2+3)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Slices 2+3 of #1790 (slice 1, the pure state machine, landed via PR #7993). Closes the remaining acceptance on #1790.\n\n## Slice 2 — wiring in `pkgs/id/web/src/cursors.ts`\n- Per-view tooltip mode (`full` / `minimal` / `hidden`, default `full`) resolved for every remote cursor through slice 1's `resolveTooltipDisplay`; hidden/minimized cursors stay tracked in plugin state but render nothing.\n- Standalone cursors: `minimal` renders the cursor line only; a label click starts the click-to-enlarge chain (big → tooltip → minimal, 1s steps via `getEnlargeStage`), and clicking a rested chain clears it. The enlarged (\"big\") label carries **pin/unpin** and **minimize** buttons (pin exempts the cursor from hidden mode).\n- Merged bars: minimal segments render name-less, big segments are marked, segments are click-to-enlarge too. Widget/cluster keys include the resolved display so the 1s refresh tick re-renders chain steps and hover tooltips.\n- Chrome: the plugin view mounts a `Cursors: <mode>` toggle button (cycles full → minimal → hidden) plus one **Restore** button per minimized cursor — the minimize/restore list for all modes, fed by `partitionCursorsByMinimized`.\n- Exported `setCursorTooltipMode` / `getCursorTooltipMode` for embedders/tests.\n\n## Slice 3 — lifecycle logging\n- Client (`cursors.ts` + pure helpers in `cursor-utils.ts`): `[cursor-lifecycle]` lines for **first-inactive** (age ≥ FADE_START_MS) and **minimum-reached** (≥ FADE_END_MS), logged once per inactive stretch, **removed** on removal, and **hover / unhover** from the label hover handlers.\n- Server (`pkgs/id/src/web/collab.rs`): `[cursor-lifecycle] first-seen` when a client_id enters the cursor map, and the 5-minute disconnect removal now logs as `[cursor-lifecycle] removed`.\n\n## Liveness verification (issue acceptance)\nInactivity is **connection-liveness based, not pointer-idleness based**: the server (`collab.rs`) pings every 30s and closes the socket after a 30-minute pong timeout; a connected client's cursor stays in the server map (it is only marked disconnected on socket close and removed 5 minutes later), and joining clients receive it with `idleSecs`. Client-side, cursor age is time since the last relayed cursor frame for that peer (`lastUpdate`, fed by websocket CURSOR frames / Init), never local pointer events; removal arrives as the server's CURSOR_REMOVE broadcast. No code in either path reads pointer-idle state.\n\n## Tests\n- `bunx vitest run` (pkgs/id/web): cursor-tooltip-state + cursor-utils + collab = 127/127 pass, including 4 new lifecycle tests; full suite 710 passed / 9 skipped with **one pre-existing failure** in `search-panel.test.ts` (role=search aria-label) that fails identically on clean main — filed as #8012.\n- `bunx tsc --noEmit`: clean. `cargo check --lib` (pkgs/id): passes.\n\n🤖 Queue worker lane code-w, task 14115.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796806717&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8013&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8013&signature=ffd6eac47b61e902c35a6b0a20a7f49b18d6abdb310b5f67368c6bd6a7340792\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8013?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":